    "wikipedia:en": {
      "qid": "Q80402",
      "lang": "en",
      "title": "FishVille",
      "extract": "FishVille is a defunct real-time aquarium simulation game developed by Zynga that was available as an application on the social-networking website Facebook. The game allowed members of Facebook to manage virtual aquariums by rearing fish. As of October 2011, FishVille had 1.6 million monthly active users. The game was discontinued on December 5, 2012.",
